LAMMPS (29 Aug 2024 - Update 1)
  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task


    units           real
    atom_style      full
    boundary        p p p
    bond_style      harmonic
    angle_style     harmonic

    pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 12.00
    pair_modify     mix arithmetic shift yes
    kspace_style    pppm 1.0e-4
    special_bonds   lj/coul 0.0 0.0 0.0

    if $(is_file(system.cpt)) then "read_restart system.cpt" else "read_data ../share/equil_nvt.data"
